  "post": {
    "summary": "restart Instance",
    "description": "Restarts the instance on its worker (fire-and-forget), including a stopped instance. Requires the `instance:execute` permission. Checks the owner's disk, memory and CPU quotas before sending the command; an already running instance is counted only once. Returns 403 if a quota is exceeded.",
